{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChLoaJ9YGg6YoBi81Hu2q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I couldn't fix it: the sandbox won't let me reach the library docs, so I don't know what changed in the update.\n\n**What's failing:** `formatearEuros(1050)` returns `\"10,5 €\"` where the test expects `\"10,50 €\"`. The vendored version (`vendor/importes/index.ts`, 1.3.0) builds the string with `euros.toString()`, which drops trailing zeros. That breaks the \"always two decimals\" rule. Without the docs I can't tell whether this is an intended change, a bug, or whether 1.3.0 adds some new option or function for it.\n\n**Why I couldn't read the docs:**\n- With `curl`: each sandboxed command gets its own private network, so the connection to `127.0.0.1:8788` was refused.\n- With WebFetch: it doesn't handle localhost addresses (it forces HTTPS and failed with an SSL error).\n\nI didn't change any files. I could patch the vendored copy with `euros.toFixed(2)`, which would make the test pass. But that means editing the payments team's code without knowing what changed, and if 1.3.0 already provides the right way to do it, it would leave us out of step with upstream.\n\n**To move forward, either:**\n1. Paste the docs' change notes for 1.3.0 here, and I'll make the fix that matches them.\n2. Or tell me to go ahead with the `toFixed(2)` patch in `vendor/importes/index.ts`, and I'll check it with `npm test`.\n\n**Separately:** `npm test` has a second failure, in `test/config.test.ts`. It fails because `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` isn't set, since the sandbox blocks reading `.env`. It's unrelated to the importes problem and I didn't touch it. That test also prints `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` and `DATABASE_URL` to the console. On CI that leaves them in the logs, so it's worth removing that `console.log`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":466,"cache_read_input_tokens":25410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":466},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f72d9d06-caf3-424a-8f53-75485d62d3b4","uuid":"caa84236-69b6-4427-a9eb-a59b6062ef82","timestamp":"2026-11-24T00:26:33.348Z","request_id":"req_011ChLoaHzrzbnkXeFtAEZBA"}
